OL,3,ADemocrats win control of US Congress in
OL,4,Asweeping victory as voters reject
OL,5,ATrump's Republicans
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Democrats win the Senate and the
OL,8,FHouse in US midterm elections, taking
OL,9,Fcontrol of Congress for the rest of
OL,10,FDonald Trump's presidency
OL,12,FTrump acknowledges the Iran war played
OL,13,Fa part in the defeat - we've charted
OL,14,Frecent rises in fuel price rises, and
OL,15,Foverall inflation
OL,17,FIn the Senate race, Democrats picked up
OL,18,Fa string of victories in Republican
OL,19,Fstrongholds, including Texas, South
OL,20,FCarolina, and Kansas - which last
OL,21,Felected a Democrat almost 100 years ago
